		{"id":"a97ce5b10374d865","type":"text","text":"Tharizdun's sacrifice:\n\nPrisoner frozen in time - Aurora Watch guard\nBlade of broken mirrors \n\nCast that which you value into Oblivion. *What do you value?*\n\nStrength | Others | Myself\n\n- prisoner (get item)\n- self sacrifice (save prisoner & get item)\n- item (save prisoner)\n","x":1440,"y":649,"width":381,"height":451},
